    "body": "Hi @fujitatomoya \r\n\r\nI have just built ros2 from sources (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ros2/ros2/28a83a843324918293ccd0d106117cf2fa4e33a6/ros2.repos), and I am able to reproduce the bug with your example:\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\nfmrico@argo:~/ros/ros2/rolling_ws$ source install/setup.bash\r\nfmrico@argo:~/ros/ros2/rolling_ws$ ros2 run demo_nodes_cpp add_two_ints_server\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nfmrico@argo:~/ros/ros2/rolling_ws$ source install/setup.bash\r\nfmrico@argo:~/ros/ros2/rolling_ws$ ros2 run prover_rclcpp rclcpp_1968\r\nClient: async_send_request call !!!\r\n[INFO] [1657607371.285664924] [client]: Result(1st) = 3\r\nterminate called after throwing an instance of 'std::future_error'\r\n  what():  std::future_error: No associated state\r\n[ros2run]: Aborted\r\n```\r\n\r\nBTW, I had to modify your test to wait for service, otherwise, I got this error:\r\n\r\n```\r\nClient: async_send_request call !!!\r\ncannot publish data, at /home/fmrico/ros/ros2/rolling_ws/src/ros2/rmw_fastrtps/rmw_fastrtps_shared_cpp/src/rmw_publish.cpp:62 during '__function__'\r\n[ERROR] [1657607708.993082021] [client.rclcpp]: Error in destruction of rcl subscription handle: Failed to delete datareader, at /home/fmrico/ros/ros2/rolling_ws/src/ros2/rmw_fastrtps/rmw_fastrtps_shared_cpp/src/subscription.cpp:52, at /home/fmrico/ros/ros2/rolling_ws/src/ros2/rcl/rcl/src/rcl/subscription.c:183\r\ncannot publish data, at /home/fmrico/ros/ros2/rolling_ws/src/ros2/rmw_fastrtps/rmw_fastrtps_shared_cpp/src/rmw_publish.cpp:62 during '__function__'\r\nFail in delete datareader, at /home/fmrico/ros/ros2/rolling_ws/src/ros2/rmw_fastrtps/rmw_fastrtps_shared_cpp/src/rmw_service.cpp:103 during '__function__'\r\n[ros2run]: Segmentation fault\r\n```\r\n\r\nDo you suggest any other test? Do you need more info about the system?\r\n\r\nI am using g++ (Ubuntu 11.2.0-19ubuntu1) 11.2.0\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nFrancisco\r\n\r\n",
