    "updated_at": "2022-07-12T08:21:23Z",
    "body": "Please notice that [FutureAndRequestId](https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/blob/f43a9198ebb033b43b4bb7b0d8ea2d2798bd566e/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/client.hpp#L404) is not a `shared_future`.\r\n\r\nIt seems that this is a feature request.\r\n\r\nAfter updating from \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/blob/f43a9198ebb033b43b4bb7b0d8ea2d2798bd566e/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/client.hpp#L607-L616\r\n\r\nto\r\n\r\n```c++\r\n  SharedFutureAndRequestId\r\n  async_send_request(SharedRequest request)\r\n  {\r\n    Promise promise;\r\n    auto future = promise.get_future().share();\r\n    auto req_id = async_send_request_impl(\r\n      *request,\r\n      std::move(promise));\r\n    return SharedFutureAndRequestId(std::move(future), req_id);\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe test application should be worked.",
