    "body": "Hi @fmrico ,\r\n\r\nI'll create a PR and then ask @ivanpauno to help review it. I am not very clear why [this method](https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/blob/f43a9198ebb033b43b4bb7b0d8ea2d2798bd566e/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/client.hpp#L607-L616) returns `future` but others([1](https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/blob/f43a9198ebb033b43b4bb7b0d8ea2d2798bd566e/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/client.hpp#L642), [2](https://github.com/ros2/rclcpp/blob/f43a9198ebb033b43b4bb7b0d8ea2d2798bd566e/rclcpp/include/rclcpp/client.hpp#L673)) returns `shared_future`?",
